{"speciesId":3,"names":{"fr":"Florizarre","es":"Venusaur","en":"Venusaur","ja":"フシギバナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"The plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"The plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The flower on its back catches the sun's rays. The sunlight is then absorbed and used for energy."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"By spreading the broad petals of its flower and catching the sun's rays, it fills its body with power."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It is able to con­ vert sunlight into energy. As a result, it is more powerful in the summertime."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"As it warms it­ self and absorbs the sunlight, its flower petals release a pleasant fragrance."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"There is a large flower on VENUSAUR’s back. The flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"There is a large flower on VENUSAUR’s back. The flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"VENUSAUR’s flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A bewitching aroma wafts from its flower. The fragrance becalms those engaged in a battle."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attract